[Here is my summary of "The Case of CICA" from the 4th Conference on
Computers, Freedom, and Privacy.  The full document is available via
WWW/Mosaic from the CAF Archive as http://www.eff.org/CAF/cfp94.kadie.html.
The plain text version is ftp://ftp.eff.org/pub/CAF/statements/cfp94.kadie.
